  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\">此作品採用<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fchoosealicense.com%252flicenses%252fmit%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MIT 授權條款</a>！</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>這張地圖包含 <strong>7 座島嶼</strong>！</p><p>這是我首次認真嘗試製作 WorldPainter 地圖。歡迎在留言區提供意見！</p><p>地圖詳細資訊：</p><ul>\n<li>世界大小：<strong>1024x1024</strong></li>\n<li>製作工具：<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.worldpainter.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">WorldPainter</a></strong></li>\n<li>包含洞穴：<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">是</span></li>\n<li>包含地下洞窟：<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">是</span></li>\n<li>包含峽谷：<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">否</span></li>\n<li>包含礦物：<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">是</span></li>\n</ul><p>螢幕截圖使用的工具：</p><ul>\n<li>Complementary 光影包（無綁定版）→ <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fshader%252fcomplementary-unbound\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">modrinth</a> / <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/shaders/complementary-unbound\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">curseforge</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Haubna\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">物理模組（專業版）</a> → 水面的細微波紋</li>\n</ul><p>世界特徵 / 自訂物件：<br>- 樹木：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fplanetminecraft.com%252fproject%252fpalm-tree-pack%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">棕櫚樹</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fplanetminecraft.com%252fproject%252fnative-trees-of-europe-template-repository-1779952%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">其他樹木</a></li>\n</ul><p>- 地面特徵：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fplanetminecraft.com%252fproject%252fjud-s-custom-stones-bushes%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">灌木</a></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p>MCPlanet 連結：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fproject%252f1-19-1024x1024-island-map%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.planetminecraft.com/project/1-19-1024x1024-island-map/</a></p>",
